''This was the first initial version of the Afterbirth † DLC expansion. For an overview on content added in Afterbirth †, please see this page: [[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth †]]''

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Additions ===
* Added the following items to the Golden Chest pool:
** {{i|Sack of Pennies}}
** {{i|Little Baggy}}
** {{i|Mystery Sack}}
** {{i|Rune Bag}}
** {{i|Bomb Bag}}
** {{i|Blood Bag}}
** {{i|IV Bag}}.

=== Changes ===
* After 5 uses, the {{i|Glowing Hourglass}} will turn into {{i|The Hourglass}}.

=== Fixes ===
* [[Spiked chest]]s will now correctly damage you on {{s|Chest}} and {{s|Dark Room}}.
* Charge items now correctly work with [[transformation]]s.

